<title>GREECE: GREEK CAPITAL MKT COMMISSION OKS EUROPEAN RELIANCE IPO.</title>
<headline>GREEK CAPITAL MKT COMMISSION OKS EUROPEAN RELIANCE IPO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's capital markets commission cleared the initial public offering of insurance firm European Reliance for listing on the bourse's main market, it said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The commission also approved the investment services (EPEY) license of Alpha Finance and Kavala Investments.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
